  - type: book
    authors:
      - family-names: Battin
        given-names: "R. H."
    title: >-
      An Introduction to the Mathematics and Methods of Astrodynamics
    edition: "revised"
    publisher:
      name: "AIAA"
    year: 1999
    notes: >-
      Chapter 4 for the conic relations behind the closed-form two-body
      propagation that serves as the integrator's independent reference.
  - type: report
    institution:
